        "stepNumber": 1,
        "description": "Stand on the yoga mat with feet hip-width apart, holding a dumbbell in each hand with palms facing forward."
      },
      {
        "stepNumber": 2,
        "description": "Keeping your elbows close to your torso and your upper arms stationary, exhale and slowly curl the dumbbells toward your shoulders."
      },
      {
        "stepNumber": 3,
        "description": "Pause briefly at the top of the movement while maintaining control of the weights."
      },
      {
        "stepNumber": 4,
        "description": "Inhale and slowly lower the dumbbells back to the starting position until your arms are fully extended."
      },
      {
        "stepNumber": 5,
        "description": "Repeat for the desired number of repetitions while maintaining proper posture and controlled movement throughout the exercise."
